<title>INDIA: India-Debt brokers quotes on CPs, CDs - July 11.</title>
<headline>India-Debt brokers quotes on CPs, CDs - July 11.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following are some indicative quotes made by Bombay-based brokers for India commercial papers (CPs) and certificate of deposits (CDs) on Friday.</p>
<p>.</p>
<p>COMMERCIAL PAPER	   30 days     90 days    180 days</p>
<p>							     (Bid/offer)</p>
<p>----------------------   ---------   --------- -----------</p>
<p>P1+ rated companies	8.50/8.25   9.50/9.10  9.75/10.00</p>
<p>P1  rated companies	9.25/8.75  10.25/9.75 10.00/10.50</p>
<p>.</p>
<p>CERTIFICATE OF DEPOSITS  3-months    6-months   12-months</p>
<p>							     (Bid/offer)</p>
<p>----------------------   ---------   --------   ----------</p>
<p> Foreign Banks	     8.25/8.75   9.00/9.25 10.00/10.50</p>
<p>.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22 265 9000</p>
